<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TOULOUSE GRAND PRIX RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>TOULOUSE, France 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $400,000</p>
<p>Toulouse Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>5-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) 6-2</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat Sjeng Schalken (Netherlands) 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat Andrei Chesnokov (Russia) 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>2-Cedric Pioline (France) beat Olivier Delaitre (France) 4-6</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Jacco Eltingh (Netherlands) 6-7</p>
<p>(2-7) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Add first round:</p>
<p>Bernd Karbacher (Germany) beat 3-Arnaud Boetsch (France) 2-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>4-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Fabrice Santoro (France)</p>
<p>6-3 3-6 7-6 (7-1)</p>
</text>
